    "title": "3e Encore",
    "description": "3e Encore Tickets is a state-of-the-art mobile ticketing application designed for our customer\u2019s convenience. It will reduce fraud, upgrade security and digitalize your tickets purchase processes.\r\n\r\nWith the app, you can:\r\n\r\n1-Download your purchased tickets instantly to your smartphone and keep them with you ready for the event.\r\n\r\n2-Transfer tickets to your friends or family through the ticket transfer option using only their phone numbers. The transfer takes only a few seconds.\r\n\r\n3-Access the event with your digital tickets in a quick and easy way by presenting your QR code on entry. \r\n\r\n4--Keep up to date with any important event information with push notifications.",
